  "description": "Vintage Western is a powerful display font inspired by classic western signage and old-town typography. Featuring bold letterforms with a rugged distressed texture, this font brings an authentic Wild West atmosphere to your designs. Perfect for posters, branding, logos, apparel, packaging, signage, and retro-themed projects, Vintage Western delivers a strong, masculine, and eye-catching look with timeless western charm.",
